%T A400705 2,2,1,10,1,2,2,3,1,3,1,4,1,2,4,1
%N A400705 A version of the building sequence A399633 for integer-numbered plots: heights of buildings at negative-numbered plots, in reverse order.
%C A400705 In A399633 the buildings are erected on a semi-infinite row of plots numbered 1, 2, 3, 4, ... In the present sequence the buildings are erected along an infinite row of plots labeled with the integers, in order at lots 0, 1, -1, 2, -2, 3, -3, ..., using the same rule as in A399633.
%C A400705 This sequence shows the heights of the buildings at plots 0, -1, -2, -3, -4, ...
%H A400705 Jonas Karlsson, <a href="/A400705/a400705.png">pinplot of two-way sequence</a>
